# Generated by the browser render tests / tuner on every run. Keep only the
# comparison inputs (reference.jpg and its committed crop reference-canvas.png,
# see scripts/make-reference-canvas.mjs) and the documented Arcentry fidelity
# milestones (scene-json-arcentry*.png). The measured visual test writes to
# ../../artifacts/visual/ instead (see the package README).
*.png
!reference-canvas.png
!scene-json-arcentry*.png
